# Persistent Worker Runtime — Codeowners
#
# This file does not define any requirements for landing PRs. Its
# purpose is to allow automation of courtesy pings to the relevant
# maintainer(s) when any of the paths listed here are modified. This
# matches the nodejs/node CODEOWNERS convention (see
# https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS).
#
# Codeowners must always be teams or maintainers, never individuals
# without their consent. For a single-maintainer JS library the
# pattern collapses to one owner — listed here for the future when
# the project gains collaborators.

# Core runtime
/src/                          @FelipeMiiller
/test/                         @FelipeMiiller
/benchmarks/                   @FelipeMiiller
/examples/                     @FelipeMiiller

# Specs and operational docs
/.specs/                       @FelipeMiiller
/.agents/                      @FelipeMiiller
/docs/                         @FelipeMiiller
/README.md                     @FelipeMiiller
/CONTRIBUTING.md               @FelipeMiiller

# CI and GitHub metadata
/.github/                      @FelipeMiiller
/package.json                  @FelipeMiiller